                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Gameplay is not very engainging and it’s buggy. On the other hand, when u have a game that can only be played online and is completely dead, Steam should remove it from the store after x years to prevent other playera from buying it, since they won’t actually be able to play it.\n\nI’m currently trying to get all the achievements with another player who played the game back in the day, since if someone gives up during a match it counts as a win for the other player.\n\nAlso, having to wait 24h for the other player’s turn must have been absolutely awful back when the game was active. I can’t even imagine having to play like that.\n\nDon’t buy it.",
